<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Tonight You Are Mine</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Technicolors</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Ultraviolet Disguise (Deluxe Edition)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0Sjz8pTu8vcVvGP5rtyh3Q</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.140" end="00:20.316">In a sense I'm such a mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.316" end="00:25.294">Watching you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.294" end="00:31.296">The air is cold, so hard to breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.296" end="00:36.063">Still your breath is all I see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.063" end="00:38.858">Reflect the sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.858" end="00:46.520">Light the one that I could never be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.520" end="00:49.260">Thought I heard you call my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.260" end="00:53.227">Thought that I could take the blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.227" end="00:58.540">If you could have it all, why do you want me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.540" end="01:06.540">So let me slip inside your ultraviolet disguise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.298" end="01:12.964">The daylight holds you close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.964" end="01:17.349">But tonight you are mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.349" end="01:25.349">Mine, mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.667" end="01:34.533">In a sense I'm nothing less</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.533" end="01:37.630">Than who you claim to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.630" end="01:40.767">But you're dressed in pixels clear as crystals</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.767" end="01:42.445">On my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.445" end="01:46.762">Just one more time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.762" end="01:51.765">If you could have it all, why do you want me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.765" end="01:59.765">So let me slip inside your ultraviolet disguise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.375" end="02:06.151">The daylight holds you close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.151" end="02:10.535">But tonight you are mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.535" end="02:18.535">Mine, mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.850" end="02:25.090">Don't be so naive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.090" end="02:27.961">You know that you are all I see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.961" end="02:29.754">And I cannot believe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.754" end="02:32.063">The monopoly that bleeds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.063" end="02:40.063">From your pores to the shores of the sea</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.814" end="03:03.814">So let me slip inside your ultraviolet disguise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.433" end="03:10.191">The daylight holds you close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.191" end="03:14.516">But tonight you are mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.516" end="03:17.092">Mine, mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.092" end="03:25.092">So let me slip inside your ultraviolet disguise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.692" end="03:31.477">The daylight holds you close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.477" end="03:35.892">But tonight you are mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.892" end="03:39.892">Mine, mine</p></div></body></tt>